  "description": "In a ruined world where the dead rise as monsters, Johan survives in the outskirts by baking bread and bartering at the local village. One day, he’s chased by undead monsters back to his home, and he unleashes a blazing fire upon them… only to find two scorchingly hot men alive and well. Calion and Alexis, returned to their human selves, spend their time testing Johan’s limits on curing the undead… and the limits of what he can take into his delicious buns.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
